<style>
    .cookie-banner {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 20px;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        width: 90%;
        max-width: 600px;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        padding: 20px 25px;
        z-index: 10000;
        display: none; /* Oculto por padrão, JS ativa */
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 15px;
        border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        font-family: var(--font-principal);
    }

    .cookie-content {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .cookie-content a {
        color: #1B4332; /* Verde Yelo */
        text-decoration: underline;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .cookie-actions {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .btn-cookie-accept {
        background-color: #1B4332; /* Verde Yelo */
        color: white;
        border: none;
        padding: 10px 24px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: bold;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn-cookie-accept:hover {
        background-color: #143326;
    }

    /* Responsivo: Em desktop fica lado a lado */
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .cookie-banner {
            flex-direction: row;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .cookie-actions {
            margin-top: 0;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
    }
</style>

<div id="cookie-consent-banner" class="cookie-banner">
    <div class="cookie-content">
        <p>A Yelo usa cookies essenciais para funcionar. Também gostaríamos de usar cookies de Analytics e Marketing para melhorar nosso serviço. <a href="/privacidade">Saiba mais</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cookie-actions" style="gap: 10px;">
        <button id="btn-reject-cookies" class="btn-cookie-accept" style="background-color: transparent; color: #1B4332; border: 1px solid #1B4332;">Apenas Essenciais</button>
        <button id="btn-accept-cookies" class="btn-cookie-accept">Aceitar Todos</button>
    </div>
</div>

<script nonce="<%= nonce %>">
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
        const cookieBanner = document.getElementById('cookie-consent-banner');
        const acceptBtn = document.getElementById('btn-accept-cookies');
        const rejectBtn = document.getElementById('btn-reject-cookies');
        
        if (window.ConsentManager && !window.ConsentManager.hasInteracted()) {
            setTimeout(() => {
                cookieBanner.style.display = 'flex';
            }, 500);
        }

        if (acceptBtn) {
            acceptBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
                window.ConsentManager.acceptAll();
                cookieBanner.style.display = 'none';
            });
        }
        
        if (rejectBtn) {
            rejectBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
                window.ConsentManager.rejectAll();
                cookieBanner.style.display = 'none';
            });
        }
    });
</script>
